            BaseField.SelectedIndexChanged+=delegate{var old=FlowSourceTarget.Find(previousBase);var next=FlowSourceTarget.Find(((Choice)BaseField.SelectedItem).Id);if(!loading){if(ExtensionField.Text==(old==null?"txt":old.Extension))ExtensionField.Text=next==null?"txt":next.Extension;if(InstructionsField.Text==(old==null?"":old.Instructions))InstructionsField.Text=next==null?"":next.Instructions;}previousBase=((Choice)BaseField.SelectedItem).Id;Changed();};
            debounce.Tick+=delegate{debounce.Stop();PersistDraft(false);};FormClosing+=ClosingEditor;Disposed+=delegate{debounce.Stop();debounce.Dispose();};Shown+=delegate{var area=Screen.FromControl(this).WorkingArea;if(Height>area.Height)Height=Math.Max(MinimumSize.Height,area.Height-20);NameField.Focus();};
